The intent ledger panel: core intent list --json and a Quickshell panel that reads it, INT-330
JSON: a new pure intent/ledger_json.rs builds schema 1 (counts total done in_progress planned blocked cancelled, intents with id title status blocked vision gates format depends_on file, recent_closed as the last five closed.tsv rows newest first, last_close, tree clean and pushed); unreadable values are null, never 0 or false; core intent list --json and core intent show <id> --json print only JSON to stdout, warnings on stderr; show answers an open id, a closed id and an unknown id (nothing, exit 1); red tests first in a temp ledger. serde and serde_json are already in core.
Panel: zero/panels/ledger/shell.qml plus fixture.json, read-only, polls core intent list --json every 10 seconds or on r, LEDGER_FIXTURE reads the fixture; a Rust test keeps the fixture keys equal to the schema; docs/TREE.md row for zero/panels/. Look as ref-ledger.jpg and ref-register.jpg: dark, live badge, total done and pending cards (pending is planned only), rows with number title one-sentence vision status and gates, then the last five closed, footer with last close and clean and pushed.
Launch: a new intent/panel.rs and core intent panel start quickshell -p with the panels path from zero_core::paths, detached, as a floating window; quickshell missing is a green safe stop naming sudo pacman -S quickshell. Grey for cancelled, the floating window, core intent panel and the list capability are starting points to check while testing.
Limits: one production file per job, no new dependencies, no writes from the panel, text output of list and show unchanged, no Hyprland or ~/.config changes, no banner change, no installs; stop and ask on a Rust file beyond ledger_json.rs and panel.rs, a JSON blocked count disagreeing with the banner after 321, a missing QML type, or zero/panels/ failing doors checks. Must not change: closed.tsv and intent files, live state.db, Cargo.toml members, root. Each commit carries Intent: INT-330 and the Seal. G4, G5 and G7 on the laptop after Christian installs quickshell; core minor bump.
